src/pydantic_ai_hoja/_bundle/ contains the Hoja plugin runtime built by hoja-work/hoja-claude-plugin
(https://github.com/hoja-work/hoja-claude-plugin, MIT). Each file is copied byte for byte; its source commit
and SHA-256 hash are recorded in src/pydantic_ai_hoja/_bundle/MANIFEST.json and checked by
`python scripts/vendor_bundle.py --check`.

The bundle includes code from cloverinternational/trebol (https://github.com/cloverinternational/trebol),
vendored unmodified by that repository.
